// 1. build ECSI Karras schedule ($\rho_k = 0.6$, $\sigma_{min}=0.15$, len $N{+}1$)
// 2. $\hat x_0 \leftarrow D(x_T, t_{max})$;  $x \leftarrow \mathrm{BS}(\hat x_0, x_T, t_0)$
// 3. for $i = 0 \ldots N-1$ do
// 4.   $\hat x_0 \leftarrow D(x, t_i)$;  push to history
// 5.   $\lambda_s \leftarrow \overline{\log(b_s/c_s)}$;  $\lambda_t \leftarrow \overline{\log(b_t/c_t)}$
// 6.   $\eta_i \leftarrow 0.4 \cdot t_i/t_{max}$
// 7.   $\omega \leftarrow \eta_i \alpha_t \rho_t \sqrt{1 - \rho_t^2/\rho_s^2}$;  $v \leftarrow \sqrt{c_t^2 - \omega^2}/c_s$
// 8.   if $|H| \ge 2$:  $r \leftarrow (\lambda_t - \lambda_s)/(\lambda_s - \lambda_{prev})$;  $\tilde x_0 \leftarrow \hat x_0 + 0.5\, r\,(\hat x_0 - \hat x_0^{prev})$
// 9.   $x \leftarrow (b_t - v b_s)\tilde x_0 + (a_t - v a_s) x_T + v x + \mathbb{1}[i \ne N-2]\,\omega \epsilon$
// 10. return $x$, reported nfe $= N$

// 1. $\hat x_0^{prev} \leftarrow D(x_T, t_{max})$;  $x \leftarrow \mathrm{BS}(\hat x_0^{prev}, x_T, t_0)$
// 2. for $i = 0 \ldots N-1$ do (use input ts)
// 3.   $\hat x_0^{raw} \leftarrow D(x, t_i)$
// 4.   $\phi \leftarrow (i+1)/N$
// 5.   cur $\leftarrow \overline{(\hat x_0^{raw} - \hat x_0^{prev})^2}$;  vel $\leftarrow \overline{(\hat x_0^{raw} - \hat x_0^{prev,prev})^2}$
// 6.   extrap $\leftarrow \hat x_0^{raw} + 0.16(1-\phi)^{1.2}(\hat x_0^{raw} - \hat x_0^{prev})$
// 7.   gate $\leftarrow (0.55 + 0.25\phi)\cdot \mathrm{clip}(\text{cur}/(\text{cur}+\text{vel}+\epsilon), 0.15, 0.85)$
// 8.   $\hat x_0 \leftarrow$ gate$\cdot\hat x_0^{raw} + (1-\text{gate})\cdot$extrap;  if $i \ge N-2$:  $\hat x_0 \leftarrow 0.88\hat x_0^{raw} + 0.12\hat x_0^{prev}$
// 9.   $\eta_i \leftarrow 0.42(1-\phi)^{1.6}\,\eta$;  apply DBIM update with this $\eta_i$, drop noise on last 2 iterations
// 10. return $x$

// 1. $\hat x_0 \leftarrow D(x_T, t_{max})$;  $x \leftarrow \mathrm{BS}(\hat x_0, x_T, t_0)$;  history $\leftarrow [\hat x_0]$
